The Atlas Copco SMARTLINK app has everything you need to keep a close eye on your equipment. All the relevant information is made available, anywhere and at any time !  

1. Have all your valuable compressed air equipment information available at your fingertips; 

2.Find all machine details directly on your mobile device without looking for paperwork, including the complete service history of your machines;

3.Never lose your Spare parts and instruction manuals again, and find them in the blink of an eye 4. Keep track of all your machine events live, via the integration of our SMARTLINK connectivity solution;

5. Analyze KPI’s without waiting for specialists to register and forward the data;

6. Use the app to get in touch with your local service provider for support or parts ordering.

With the Izola Saver Mobile app, you can manage your Saver account(s) on the go. Our app is user-friendly, fast and safe and provides you with the following functions:

• A secure and simple logon process;
• An account overview screen to check your Izola Saver account balances;
• A mini statement page that provides you with the 11 most recent transactions on your Izola Saver account(s);
• Transfer funds out of your Izola Saver account(s) to your linked principal bank account;
• Transfer funds into your Izola Saver account(s) from your linked principal bank via SEPA direct debit;
• Possibility to open Saver+ (term deposit) accounts;
